<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-10 mx-auto">
      <div class="card shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body p-5">
          <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-4">Refund Policy</h1>

          <p class="lead mb-4">Last Updated: <%= typeof lastUpdatedDate !== 'undefined' ? lastUpdatedDate : '12 Apr 2026' %></p>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">1. Ticket Refund Policy</h2>
            <p>This policy applies to all tickets purchased through our Platform for concerts, events, and performances.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">2. General Refund Terms</h2>
            <p>All ticket sales are considered final once completed. However, refunds may be issued under the following circumstances:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>event cancellation by the organizer or artist</li>
              <li>significant rescheduling of the event</li>
              <li>substantial venue change that makes attendance impractical</li>
              <li>verified technical or payment processing errors resulting in duplicate/incorrect charges</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">3. Event Cancellation</h2>
            <p>If an event is canceled by the organizer or artist:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>a refund of the ticket amount will be initiated</li>
              <li>refunds are typically processed within 7–10 business days</li>
              <li>notification will be sent via email</li>
              <li>refunds will be credited to the original payment method</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">4. Event Rescheduling</h2>
            <p>If an event is rescheduled:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>previously issued tickets remain valid for the new date</li>
              <li>if you are unable to attend, you may request a refund within 14 days of the rescheduling notice</li>
              <li>refund requests submitted after 14 days may not be accepted</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">5. Venue Changes</h2>
            <p>If the event venue is changed:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>tickets remain valid for the new venue</li>
              <li>if the new venue is located more than 50 km from the original venue, you may request a refund</li>
              <li>refund requests must be submitted within 14 days from the announcement</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">6. Technical Errors and Duplicate Charges</h2>
            <p>In case of technical errors resulting in:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>duplicate payments</li>
              <li>incorrect charge amounts</li>
            </ul>
            <p>You must immediately contact us at vijaymudaliyar224@gmail.com.</p>
            <p>Refunds for verified technical errors are typically processed within 5–7 business days.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">7. Non-Refundable Fees (Important)</h2>
            <p>The following will not be refunded under any circumstances:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>platform fees</li>
              <li>convenience fees</li>
              <li>payment gateway or transaction charges</li>
              <li>service or processing fees</li>
              <li>commissions or administrative charges</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Only the base ticket price may be refunded, where eligible.</p>
            <p>Users acknowledge and agree to these charges at the time of purchase.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">8. Weather Conditions</h2>
            <p>Refunds related to weather are handled as follows:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>If an event is canceled 3–4 hours before start time due to adverse weather, the ticket amount may be refunded</li>
              <li>If bad weather occurs during the event after commencement, no refund will be issued</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">9. Refund Processing Time</h2>
            <p>Refunds are generally processed within 7–10 business days.</p>
            <p>Depending on your bank or payment provider, additional time may be required for the amount to reflect.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">10. How to Request a Refund</h2>
            <p>To request a refund:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Log in to your account</li>
              <li>Navigate to My Tickets</li>
              <li>Select the applicable ticket</li>
              <li>Click Request Refund</li>
              <li>Submit the refund form</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Notes:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>refund requests are subject to policy review and approval</li>
              <li>refunds cannot be requested after the event date has passed</li>
              <li>valid account/payment details must be provided for processing</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">11. Post-Concert Tickets</h2>
            <p>After the event date has passed:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>tickets move automatically to Past Events</li>
              <li>tickets are no longer refundable</li>
              <li>you may optionally delete old tickets from your account</li>
              <li>deletion does not erase legal and accounting transaction records</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">12. Ticket Deletion Policy</h2>
            <p>For completed events, you may delete tickets from "Past Events."</p>
            <p>Deletion is:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>permanent</li>
              <li>optional</li>
              <li>does not impact internal transaction records</li>
            </ul>
            <p>You are advised to download tickets before deletion if needed for personal records.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">13. Special Circumstances</h2>
            <p>In extraordinary events such as natural disasters, government restrictions, or public health emergencies, Rapira may announce special refund procedures applicable to affected ticket holders.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">14. Contact Information</h2>
            <p>For refund-related inquiries, please contact:</p>
            <p>📧 vijaymudaliyar224@gmail.com</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
